,{"text":"; but thou didst laugh","strong":"H6711"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":440,"title":"Genesis 18:16","segments":["¶And the men rose up from thence, and looked toward Sodom: and Abraham went with them to bring them on the way."],"ref":"Genesis 18:16","verse":16,"words":[{"text":"¶And the men","strong":"H582"},{"text":" rose up","strong":"H6965"},{"text":" from thence, and looked","strong":"H8259"},{"text":" toward","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" Sodom","strong":"H5467"},{"text":": and Abraham","strong":"H85"},{"text":" went","strong":"H1980"},{"text":" with them to bring them on the way","strong":"H7971"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":441,"title":"Genesis 18:17","segments":["And the LORD said, Shall I hide from Abraham that thing which I do;"],"ref":"Genesis 18:17","verse":17,"words":[{"text":"And the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Shall I hide","strong":"H3680"},{"text":" from Abraham","strong":"H85"},{"text":" that thing which","strong":"H834"},{"text":" I do","strong":"H6213"},{"text":";"}]},{"id":442,"title":"Genesis 18:18","segments":["Seeing that Abraham shall surely become a great and mighty nation, and all the nations of the earth shall be blessed in him?"],"ref":"Genesis 18:18","verse":18,"words":[{"text":"Seeing that Abraham","strong":"H85"},{"text":" shall surely become a great","strong":"H1419"},{"text":" and mighty","strong":"H6099"},{"text":" nation","strong":"H1471"},{"text":", and all the nations","strong":"H1471"},{"text":" of the earth","strong":"H776"},{"text":" shall be blessed","strong":"H1288"},{"text":" in him?"}]},{"id":443,"title":"Genesis 18:19","segments":["For I know him, that he will command his children and his household after him, and they shall keep the way of the LORD, to do justice and judgment; that the LORD may bring upon Abraham that which he hath spoken of him."],"ref":"Genesis 18:19","verse":19,"words":[{"text":"For I know","strong":"H3045"},{"text":" him, that","strong":"H834"},{"text":" he will command","strong":"H6680"},{"text":" his children","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" and his household","strong":"H1004"},{"text":" after him","strong":"H310"},{"text":", and they shall keep","strong":"H8104"},{"text":" the way","strong":"H1870"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", to do","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" justice","strong":"H6666"},{"text":" and judgment","strong":"H4941"},{"text":"; that the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" may bring","strong":"H935"},{"text":" upon Abraham","strong":"H85"},{"text":" that which he hath spoken","strong":"H1696"},{"text":" of him."}]},{"id":444,"title":"Genesis 18:20","segments":["And the LORD said, Because the cry of Sodom and Gomorrah is great, and because their sin is very grievous;"],"ref":"Genesis 18:20","verse":20,"words":[{"text":"And the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Because the cry","strong":"H2201"},{"text":" of Sodom","strong":"H5467"},{"text":" and Gomorrah","strong":"H6017"},{"text":" is great","strong":"H7227"},{"text":", and because their sin","strong":"H2403"},{"text":" is very","strong":"H3966"},{"text":" grievous","strong":"H3513"},{"text":";"}]},{"id":445,"title":"Genesis 18:21","segments":["I will go down now, and see whether they have done altogether according to the cry of it, which is come unto me; and if not, I will know."],"ref":"Genesis 18:21","verse":21,"words":[{"text":"I will go down","strong":"H3381"},{"text":" now, and see","strong":"H7200"},{"text":" whether they have done","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" altogether","strong":"H3617"},{"text":" according to the cry","strong":"H6818"},{"text":" of it, which is come","strong":"H935"},{"text":" unto me; and if not, I will know","strong":"H3045"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":446,"title":"Genesis 18:22","segments":["And the men turned their faces from thence, and went toward Sodom: but Abraham stood yet before the LORD."],"ref":"Genesis 18:22","verse":22,"words":[{"text":"And the men","strong":"H582"},{"text":" turne