":" five","strong":"H2568"},{"text":" of the fifty","strong":"H2572"},{"text":" righteous","strong":"H6662"},{"text":": wilt thou destroy","strong":"H7843"},{"text":" all the city","strong":"H5892"},{"text":" for [lack of] five","strong":"H2568"},{"text":"? And he said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", If I find","strong":"H4672"},{"text":" there forty","strong":"H705"},{"text":" and five","strong":"H2568"},{"text":", I will not destroy","strong":"H7843"},{"text":" [it]."}]},{"id":453,"title":"Genesis 18:29","segments":["And he spake unto him yet again, and said, Peradventure there shall be forty found there. And he said, I will not do [it] for forty's sake."],"ref":"Genesis 18:29","verse":29,"words":[{"text":"And he spake","strong":"H1696"},{"text":" unto him yet again","strong":"H3254"},{"text":", and said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Peradventure there shall be forty","strong":"H705"},{"text":" found","strong":"H4672"},{"text":" there. And he said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", I will not do","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" [it] for forty's","strong":"H705"},{"text":" sake."}]},{"id":454,"title":"Genesis 18:30","segments":["And he said [unto him], Oh let not the Lord be angry, and I will speak: Peradventure there shall thirty be found there. And he said, I will not do [it], if I find thirty there."],"ref":"Genesis 18:30","verse":30,"words":[{"text":"And he said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" [unto him], Oh","strong":"H4994"},{"text":" let not the Lord","strong":"H136"},{"text":" be angry","strong":"H2734"},{"text":", and I will speak","strong":"H1696"},{"text":": Peradventure there shall thirty","strong":"H7970"},{"text":" be found","strong":"H4672"},{"text":" there. And he said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", I will not do","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" [it], if I find","strong":"H4672"},{"text":" thirty","strong":"H7970"},{"text":" there."}]},{"id":455,"title":"Genesis 18:31","segments":["And he said, Behold now, I have taken upon me to speak unto the Lord: Peradventure there sha